      "source": [
        "# CXR Foundation Zero-Shot Classification (VERSION: FIXED_V8)\n",
        "\n",
        "This version adds `predict_batch` support and hardware detection.\n",
        "\n",
        "## ⚠️ CRITICAL SETUP\n",
        "1. **RE-UPLOAD THIS FILE**: Title must show \"FIXED_V8\".\n",
        "2. **Runtime**: Must be **GPU** (T4/A100).\n",
        "3. **Run All Cells**: Sequencing is vital."
      ]
    },
